    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 902, "2026-11-03 perf-triage-13: open, environment-blocked. test/05_perf/stress/multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl:215,225 still assert empty stderr, which needs a deployed self-hosted binary. test/05_perf/graphics_2d/simple_2d_vector_fonts_perf_spec.spl:112 still calls engine.load_font(path) on an unregistered fixture and :83,:89 still need host-pinned SIMPLE_2D_BITMAP_BASELINE_* values. Fixability: BIG/needs-stage3 for the fanout spec and baselines; the font load alone is a small spec edit to load_font_bytes but would not turn the spec green."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 903, "2026-11-13: Blocked on this host: multicore_green_fanout_spec asserts empty stderr, which needs a self-hosted binary (the seed banner cannot be suppressed through its env -i probe), and the vector-font spec needs host-pinned baselines. The font-fixture half is fixed (1fc1852855a). Regression found, not repaired here: transplant 88aac2ffe28 undid cbe6b94a79f in multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl (mkdir -p build/tmp in unique_probe_path; bin/simple fallback in simple_binary), so probes now fail with 98/127 before reaching the stderr assertion; origin/main carries the same reverted text."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 904, "2026-11-13: Probe regression repaired: cbe6b94a79f re-applied to test/05_perf/stress/multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl (mkdir -p build/tmp; bin/simple fallback). On release/1.0.0 5221a5058a8, Linux aarch64 (DGX Spark GB10), Rust seed af717f53d6bce3e5: before, 3 examples 2 failed with the harness sentinel (expected probe_write_failed, 98); after, with SIMPLE_BIN set to the seed, the probes run and the same 2 examples fail only on the empty-stderr assertion (seed banner). Row stays open on the self-hosted-binary blocker. origin/main still carries the reverted text and needs the same change."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 905, "2026-11-26 (Linux aarch64 DGX GB10, tip 79445b063c4, seed fb80903917d6d5f5). Font-fixture half: fixed on origin by ce3953a93ef, which writes the fixture to disk and uses the unmanaged load_font lane. Rows 903 and the earlier addenda credit 1fc1852855a and load_font_bytes, but that commit was itself the cause of the all-zero rows, because the provenance gate rejects identity ''. Measured: cold_p50_ns=19808476 warm_p50_ns=16662376 bitmap_checksum=772523490, so the font loads and the bitmap block runs. The six remaining failed expectations are not font loading. warm*100<=cold*75 and warm_hits 651==217 are the vector-cache reds in vector_font_perf_spec_masked_reds_2026-11-15.md. The other four (baseline ns>0, checksum>0, checksum==0, ratio<1) come from the unset host-pinned SIMPLE_2D_BITMAP_BASELINE_NS/_CHECKSUM. Fanout spec: the OS-thread probe also exited 1 (JIT reject 'cannot apply Add to an optional value', then interpreter 'cannot convert enum to int'), because ThreadHandle.join() returns i64?. The probe now uses .join().unwrap(): standalone probe rc 1 -> 0 and the JIT no longer demotes. After the fix both failing examples fail only on the empty-stderr assertion (seed banner). Still blocked: no deployed pure-Simple bin/release/<triple>/simple (bin/release absent), plus the host-pinned bitmap baseline env."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 906, "2026-11-27 W5-1: Implemented provenance-gated test font fixture registration (register_selected_font_fixture/clear_registered_selected_font_fixtures in font_registry.spl keeping 16-asset catalog intact; font_renderer_register_font_fixture_bytes across text_layout/font_renderer.spl; helpers in font_fixture.spl; simple_2d_vector_fonts_perf_spec.spl switched back to load_font_bytes with no TTF disk write; added font_fixture_registration_spec.spl). Verified: font_fixture_registration_spec 2/2 PASS, font_registry_metadata_path_spec 2/2 PASS; simple_2d_vector_fonts_perf_spec loads via load_font_bytes with checksum=562346002 checksum_mismatches=0 warm_misses=0 (fails 6 remaining interpreter-timing/masked-red/unset-baseline checks). waiting-for: deployed pure-Simple bin/release/<triple>/simple binary for multicore_green_fanout_spec empty stderr & native vector-font timing plus host-pinned SIMPLE_2D_BITMAP_BASELINE_NS/_CHECKSUM."

